# The build context is the repository root; send only what the stages COPY.
# cactup's own sources, its installer and mdb/ come from the pinned commit
# (build.sh's cactup-src context), so the checkout's copies are left out: a
# stage that reached for them would fail instead of building unpinned code.
*
!tutorial/
tutorial/**/node_modules/
tutorial/jupyter/labext/lib/
tutorial/**/build-test/
tutorial/**/labextension/
tutorial/**/__pycache__/
tutorial/**/*.egg-info/
tutorial/bakes/
tutorial/mirrors/cache/
